TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:On duty: Front & snow
DESCRIPTION:Oct 5 – Oct 18: Rake front leaves (paper bags\, out with comp
 ost). Shovel and salt if it snows.\n\nCan't do it? Swap with another unit 
 and write it on the calendar in the entrance.\nhttps://studiozenkai.com/26
 75poirier
END:VEVENT
