BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2675poirier-102-20261102-duty-repairs@studiozenkai.com
DTSTAMP:20261008T203324Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:On duty: Repairs
DESCRIPTION:Nov 2 – Nov 15: Main door lock and handle\, light bulbs (entr
 ance\, hallways)\, stairs\, other small fixes. Post what you fixed (and an
 y receipt) in the WhatsApp group.\n\nCan't do it? Swap with another unit a
 nd write it on the calendar in the entrance.\nhttps://studiozenkai.com/267
 5poirier
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2675poirier-102-20261214-duty-bins@studiozenkai.com
DTSTAMP:20261008T203324Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261214
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261228
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:On duty: Bins
DESCRIPTION:Dec 14 – Dec 27: Take the compost and garbage bins out at 7pm
  the evening before pickup\, bring them back at 7pm on pickup day. Keep th
 e garbage area clean: no bags on the ground\, lids closed\, never leave ba
 gs beside a full bin. Recycling isn't part of this job: each unit handles 
 its own bin.\n\nCan't do it? Swap with another unit and write it on the ca
 lendar in the entrance.\nhttps://studiozenkai.com/2675poirier
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2675poirier-102-20261228-duty-front-snow@studiozenkai.com
DTSTAMP:20261008T203324Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261228
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270111
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:On duty: Front & snow
DESCRIPTION:Dec 28 – Jan 10: After every snowfall: shovel the entrance an
 d stairs\, then salt. Keep bins reachable on pickup days.\n\nCan't do it? 
 Swap with another unit and write it on the calendar in the entrance.\nhttp
 s://studiozenkai.com/2675poirier
END:VEVENT
